---
import { TEAM_PLAN } from '../config/team';
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden pt-32 pb-20 md:pt-40 md:pb-28">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute -top-40 left-1/2 h-[600px] w-[800px] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-brand-blue/10 blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-20 right-0 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-brand-purple/10 blur-3xl"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
      <div class="mb-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-brand-cyan/20 bg-brand-cyan/5 px-4 py-1.5 opacity-0 animate-fade-up">
        <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-cyan animate-pulse_slow"></span>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs text-brand-cyan">Open source · GPL-3.0</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink opacity-0 animate-fade-up [animation-delay:100ms] md:text-6xl md:leading-[1.1]">
        AI intelligence for
        <span class="text-gradient">
          engineering troubleshooting
        </span>
      </h1>

      <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-muted opacity-0 animate-fade-up [animation-delay:200ms] md:text-xl">
        Investigate across repositories, infrastructure, and tickets with evidence-first AI.
        Your team stays in control — the agent gathers facts, you make the call.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 opacity-0 animate-fade-up [animation-delay:300ms] sm:flex-row">
        <a href="/contact?intent=demo" class="btn-primary w-full sm:w-auto">
          Book a demo
          <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3" />
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/iman-suherman/ai-engineering-workbench"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="btn-secondary w-full sm:w-auto"
        >
          <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M12 0C5.37 0 0 5.37 0 12c0 5.31 3.435 9.795 8.205 11.385.6.105.825-.255.825-.57 0-.285-.015-1.23-.015-2.235-3.015.555-3.795-.735-4.035-1.41-.135-.345-.72-1.41-1.23-1.695-.42-.225-1.02-.78-.015-.795.945-.015 1.62.87 1.845 1.23 1.08 1.815 2.805 1.305 3.495.99.105-.78.42-1.305.765-1.605-2.67-.3-5.46-1.335-5.46-5.925 0-1.305.465-2.385 1.23-3.225-.12-.3-.54-1.53.12-3.18 0 0 1.005-.315 3.3 1.23.96-.27 1.98-.405 3-.405s2.04.135 3 .405c2.295-1.56 3.3-1.23 3.3-1.23.66 1.65.24 2.88.12 3.18.765.84 1.23 1.905 1.23 3.225 0 4.605-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.925.435.375.81 1.095.81 2.22 0 1.605-.015 2.895-.015 3.3 0 .315.225.69.825.57A12.02 12.02 0 0024 12c0-6.63-5.37-12-12-12z" />
          </svg>
          View on GitHub
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Terminal preview -->
    <div class="relative mx-auto mt-16 max-w-4xl opacity-0 animate-fade-up [animation-delay:500ms]">
      <div class="card overflow-hidden shadow-2xl shadow-black/40 ring-1 ring-white/10">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-white/5 bg-surface-overlay px-4 py-3">
          <div class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-red-500/70"></div>
          <div class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-500/70"></div>
          <div class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-green-500/70"></div>
          <span class="ml-2 font-mono text-xs text-ink-faint">investigation-report.md</span>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-3 p-6 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed md:p-8">
          <p><span class="text-brand-cyan">Finding:</span> <span class="text-ink-muted">Gateway config change is safe to deploy. No conflicting PRs on checkout-api.</span></p>
          <p><span class="text-brand-cyan">Evidence:</span> <span class="text-ink-muted">checkout-api main — 0 open PRs. edge-gateway-config PR #42 merged yesterday.</span></p>
          <p><span class="text-brand-cyan">Risk:</span> <span class="text-ink-muted">Low. Rollback via gateway revert in &lt;5 min.</span></p>
          <p><span class="text-brand-cyan">Recommended action:</span> <span class="text-ink">Deploy gateway config to staging, then production after smoke tests.</span></p>
          <p class="pt-2 text-ink-faint">// Human reviews and copy/pastes the reply. Nothing is sent automatically.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
